                                "sense_id": "324612bf-a012-3bff-8475-f8b22fa6e395",
                                "text": "More unsettling was the origin story of the infamous tell-all book Princess in Love. Diana claimed to be outraged in 1994 when Daily Express journalist Anna Pasternak spilled the beans of her affair with former army officer James Hewitt[…]"
